#: addons/s3/src/Controller.php:120
msgid "Cache-Control"
msgstr ""

#: addons/s3/src/Controller.php:121
msgid "Optional, sent with every object, for example max-age=3600. There is no safe default: what suits a hashed asset is the opposite of what suits a page."
