#: addons/s3/src/Controller.php:134
msgid "Most paths to invalidate"
msgstr ""

#: addons/s3/src/Controller.php:135
msgid "Above this many changes it invalidates everything instead, which is one request rather than thousands. CloudFront gives a thousand paths a month free and charges beyond that."
