msgstr ""

#: addons/s3/src/Controller.php:146
msgid "Optional, stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep the saved one."
msgstr ""

#: addons/s3/src/Controller.php:152
msgid "The credentials need only s3:PutObject and s3:DeleteObject on the bucket, plus cloudfront:CreateInvalidation if a distribution is set. An account with more than that is an account that can do more than publish a site."
msgstr ""

